WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Frame Triage. Drag across the two renders. The candidate is missing the ceramic ring.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.500
Frame Triage. A small camera shift triggers the learned detector.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Frame Triage. The pixel baseline passes the same pair. The learned detector raised a false alarm.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Photon Trail. Two Counterform charges are $54.70. The top-ranked match is wrong.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.100
Photon Trail. The receipt points to October 27. Confirm entry NL-103.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.000
Photon Trail. Replaying the import changes zero ledger entries. The confirmed match survives.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.100
Cosmic Digest. Reverse the order of the two reports shown to Qwen.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.500
Cosmic Digest. The quote check accepts the release notice. The answer misses the later correction.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Cosmic Digest. The operations report puts the north camera on hold.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.500
LMMS-Nebula. Raise the first Glass lead note from D5 to F5.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:40.000
LMMS-Nebula. [Music] The browser plays the edited four-track score.
